Avoid expensive reshape for odd number of rows in conv2D (#1495)

PERF

This PR addresses tensorflow/tfjs#949; conv2D is the main source of expensive reshapes in e.g. DeepLabV3 + MobileNetV2 model: before the patch, with environmental flags 'WEBGL_PACK:true,WEBGL_PACK_DEPTHWISECONV:false', there are 70 expensive reshapes per inference - with the patch, there are only 4.

Performance is measured using [modified conv2d benchmark](https://gist.github.com/astojilj/4ce6b26807b9f9636dbe81c7efba4166) in such way that it uses conv2d by matmul implementation: 

