      "averageTimeMs": 216.8936500007112
    }
```

##### astojilj:conv-avoid-expensive-reshape branch, packed ([tf.ENV.set('WEBGL_PACK', true)](https://gist.github.com/astojilj/4ce6b26807b9f9636dbe81c7efba4166#file-packedconv2dbenchmark-patch-L25)) 
