Initialize ENV to null when the page loads. (#1785)

BUG

The current generated code has an issue where exports.ENV isn't ready at module initialization:
```
// tslint:disable-next-line:no-any
function setEnvironmentGlobal(environment) {
    exports.ENV = environment;
}
exports.setEnvironmentGlobal = setEnvironmentGlobal;
```

This will make it available:
```
exports.ENV = null;
// tslint:disable-next-line:no-any
function setEnvironmentGlobal(environment) {
    exports.ENV = environment;
}
exports.setEnvironmentGlobal = setEnvironmentGlobal;
```

